  "body": "By default `<script type=\"module\">` will omit credentials for all module fetches, much like the default for `fetch()`.\r\n\r\nHowever…\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<!-- No credentials -->\r\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"foo.js\"></script>\r\n<!-- With credentials -->\r\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"foo.js\" crossorigin></script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt feels really weird that `crossorigin` implies adding credentials for same-origin requests.",
